window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/hpc-v26-012-4da804c2640bdeb8.json"]={sha256:"4da804c2640bdeb81dffa15c572d5315f02a8f4317a99eb607ebdb2d89a69316",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v26-case-72e04e73d7a2f0e8","url":"https://docs.olcf.ornl.gov/systems/frontier_user_guide.html","title":"Frontier User Guide","titleEn":"Frontier User Guide","publisher":"Oak Ridge Leadership Computing Facility","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v26-012","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v26-012","related":[{"id":"hpc-v26-013","referenceUrls":["https://docs.alcf.anl.gov/aurora/"],"title":"Aurora GPU Max：多裝置容量與分片預算","titleEn":"Aurora GPU Max: device capacity and shard budgets","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付封裝/GCD映射、分片覆蓋與可見性診斷；32/64重現，八個GCD各有唯一分片，未把總HBM當單一共享空間；請另一位學徒依交付件重新推導一組；未通過或資料不足必須明記，不以品牌或峰值取代證據。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver package/GCD mapping, shard coverage and visibility diagnostics. Reproduce 32/64 with unique shards on eight GCDs and no assumption of one pooled HBM space. Have another learner derive one case from the handover; label failures or missing evidence without substituting brand names or peak rates.","difference":"列資料、暫存、函式庫保留三類，畫六個獨立容量框；每份陣列須有裝置歸屬；兩個元素數吻合，bytes/GiB一致且峰值存活集合未超可用容量。","differenceEn":"Separate data, scratch and library reserve in six capacity boxes, assigning each array to a device. Both counts match, bytes/GiB agree and peak live arrays fit usable capacity.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["可見GCD數D=packages×dies；等分N工作後每GCD N/D，不將封裝數當裝置數；合成N=256工作、4封裝×2GCD；另案N=512，所有GCD可用；名義式 256/(4*2) = 32 jobs/GCD；變更式 512/(4*2) = 64 jobs/GCD。數據與驗收門檻為原創教學情境，並非所列超級電腦或函式庫的實測規格。","單裝置可供陣列使用容量M−R，b bytes/元素時可放floor((M−R)/b)元素；不可直接加總跨裝置容量；合成每裝置64GiB、保留8GiB、FP64 b8；改保留16GiB，並非Aurora實際規格；名義式 (64-8)*2**30/8 = 7516192768 elements/device；變更式 (64-16)*2**30/8 = 6442450944 elements/device。數據與驗收門檻為原創教學情境，並非所列超級電腦或函式庫的實測規格。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Visible GCD count D=packages×dies; equal shards have N/D work, not N/packages. Synthetic N 256, 4 packages×2 GCD; compare N 512 with every GCD available. Nominal 256/(4*2) = 32 jobs/GCD; changed 512/(4*2) = 64 jobs/GCD. Inputs and acceptance thresholds are original teaching scenarios, not measured specifications of the named systems or libraries.","One device holds floor((M−R)/b) elements after reserve R; summing capacity does not remove partitioning requirements. Synthetic 64 GiB/device, reserve 8 GiB, FP64 b 8; compare reserve 16 GiB, not actual Aurora specifications. Nominal (64-8)*2**30/8 = 7516192768 elements/device; changed (64-16)*2**30/8 = 6442450944 elements/device. Inputs and acceptance thresholds are original teaching scenarios, not measured specifications of the named systems or libraries.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"hpc-v26-022","referenceUrls":["https://rocm.docs.amd.com/projects/HIP/en/latest/index.html"],"title":"HIP：Wavefront 假設與可攜分組","titleEn":"HIP: wavefront assumptions and portable grouping","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付封裝/GCD映射、分片覆蓋與可見性診斷；32/64重現，八個GCD各有唯一分片，未把總HBM當單一共享空間；請另一位學徒依交付件重新推導一組；未通過或資料不足必須明記，不以品牌或峰值取代證據。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver package/GCD mapping, shard coverage and visibility diagnostics. Reproduce 32/64 with unique shards on eight GCDs and no assumption of one pooled HBM space. Have another learner derive one case from the handover; label failures or missing evidence without substituting brand names or peak rates.","difference":"畫邏輯執行緒0..255及各群組邊界，將群組寬度寫成參數；4/8與32640核對成功，所有群組輸出都被消費一次。","differenceEn":"Map logical threads 0..255 and group boundaries with parameterized width. Verify 4/8 and 32640 with every partial consumed exactly once.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["可見GCD數D=packages×dies；等分N工作後每GCD N/D，不將封裝數當裝置數；合成N=256工作、4封裝×2GCD；另案N=512，所有GCD可用；名義式 256/(4*2) = 32 jobs/GCD；變更式 512/(4*2) = 64 jobs/GCD。數據與驗收門檻為原創教學情境，並非所列超級電腦或函式庫的實測規格。","教學群組數G=ceil(T/W)，W是本次裝置能力模型；不是所有AMD裝置的固定值；一block T=256執行緒；合成W64與W32比較，兩者各自獨立能力情境；名義式 ceil(256/64) = 4 execution groups/block；變更式 ceil(256/32) = 8 execution groups/block。數據與驗收門檻為原創教學情境，並非所列超級電腦或函式庫的實測規格。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Visible GCD count D=packages×dies; equal shards have N/D work, not N/packages. Synthetic N 256, 4 packages×2 GCD; compare N 512 with every GCD available. Nominal 256/(4*2) = 32 jobs/GCD; changed 512/(4*2) = 64 jobs/GCD. Inputs and acceptance thresholds are original teaching scenarios, not measured specifications of the named systems or libraries.","Teaching group count G=ceil(T/W), where W belongs to the selected device model, not all AMD devices. T 256 threads/block; compare separate synthetic device models W 64 and W 32. Nominal ceil(256/64) = 4 execution groups/block; changed ceil(256/32) = 8 execution groups/block. Inputs and acceptance thresholds are original teaching scenarios, not measured specifications of the named systems or libraries.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v26-case-38f4c5ed877c4c03","url":"https://docs.alcf.anl.gov/aurora/","title":"Aurora Machine Overview","titleEn":"Aurora Machine Overview","publisher":"Argonne Leadership Computing Facility","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v26-case-1924b759af2fd4d0","url":"https://rocm.docs.amd.com/projects/HIP/en/latest/index.html","title":"HIP documentation","titleEn":"HIP documentation","publisher":"AMD ROCm","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
